        "title": "Regression coverage and shared desktop-runtime helper",
        "summary": "A follow-up hardens the loopback guard with a reusable isDesktopRuntime() helper and adds tests across useAuraCapabilities, host-config, and native-runtime so desktop, mobile, and web clients each stay on their intended UI path.",
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "Extracted an isDesktopRuntime() helper and routed detectClientPlatform() through it, giving device-info, host-config, and capability checks a single source of truth for the desktop shell.",
            "commit_shas": [
              "9f38fe85cd0ac79831e136567742a55453502904"
