          {
            "text": "Added a useAuraCapabilities case that loads from http://127.0.0.1 with a desktop IPC bridge and asserts hasDesktopBridge is true while isNativeApp, isMobileClient, and the mobile-client dataset flag all stay false — locking in the fix from earlier in the day.",
            "commit_shas": [
              "9f38fe85cd0ac79831e136567742a55453502904"
            ],
            "confidence": "high"
          },
          {
            "text": "Expanded host-config and native-runtime tests with proper window.location mocking and cleanup of Capacitor, __AURA_BOOT_AUTH__, and ipc globals so desktop, Android, and macOS web scenarios are each covered without cross-test leakage.",
